purpose/evidence gaps and known CH2021 construction/reference obligation; place
the restricted-family ridge connection in DS if useful; align abstract,
introduction and conclusion; improve remaining exposition, especially
preliminaries. Choose fresh rewrites over patching where the old scaffold is poor.
Do not start new research campaigns or adopt every Pro suggestion automatically.

The EHZ/cylindrical-open-in-R4 statement in the frozen draft is false. The fresh
literature lane checks current primary results and exact scope. Pro supplied the
analytic pentagon proof and restricted-family ridge law; preserve attribution.
The exact HKO witness was independently corroborated, not refuted.

Two process audits are complete; `docs/process-audit/independent/reconciliation.md`
owns their comparison. Their recommendations are not all implemented or validated.
No further broad retrospective audit is required for the next sprint.

